		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>15-foot-tall sandstone statue. Triple-headed, winged, draconic tail. Fragment of a dead god, hates divinity.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 62, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +7 (1d6) or 2 longbow (far) +7 (1d8) or severance, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Antithesis</strong>. Divine spells cast with DISADV in double near.</p><p></p><p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Severance</strong>. One divine caster within double near, CHA 18+ or cut off from deity, unable to cast spells until rested.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
